    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners O'Brien Swaine are proud to present the Showhouse in Forest Close, Gorey. This home is in an exclusive development of just 17 brand New Homes all finished to the very highest of standards. Built by the renowned Nigel Clarke Developments these exceptionally spacious homes extend to an impressive c. 140 sq.m offering modern living at its finest with a perfect balance of style comfort and energy efficiency. \r\n\r\nThe show home in Forest Close has been thoughtfully designed with a clever family friendly layout and premium finishes throughout. The kitchens feature sleek contemporary Shaker Style units with quartz countertops while the latest air to water heating system with thermostatically controlled zones ensures all year-round comfort and low running costs. \r\nIdeally positioned in a quiet well established part of town the location offers the perfect balance of peace and convenience just 5 minutes from the motorway with Goreys vibrant Main Street boasting shops restaurants boutiques and amenities close by. Recreational needs are well catered for with parks sports facilities golf courses and beautiful beaches only a short drive away. \r\n\r\nForest Close invites you to experience modern living in a thriving community where design meets practicality and lifestyle comes first.\r\n\r\n Inclusions Contemporary Shaker Style Kitchen Units Appliances Quartz Kitchen Counter Top Bathroom Suites Tiling includes: En suite Floor and Shower Main Bathroom Floor and Two Walls over Bath Downstairs Bathroom Floor \r\n\r\n(Furniture available to purchase at extra cost)"
      },
